{"timestamp":"2026-08-13T03:48:26.653Z","ordinal":13461,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ff72b-b494-79c2-a514-f864fcba9054","turn_id":"019ff8a2-6289-7163-9249-f7ccb2880c20","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-79276ecf-7788-4cd9-b8e1-9d90391bb23e","process_id":"34909","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n \"office bot|product digest|Lobu Team|prod logs|Slack digest|org-owned\" /Users/burakemre/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md | head -40 && nl -ba /Users/burakemre/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md | sed -n '755,775p'"],"cwd":"file:///Users/burakemre/Code/lobu","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'office bot|product digest|Lobu Team|prod logs|Slack digest|org-owned' /Users/burakemre/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md","query":"office bot|product digest|Lobu Team|prod logs|Slack digest|org-owned","path":"MEMORY.md"},{"type":"read","cmd":"nl -ba /Users/burakemre/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md","name":"MEMORY.md","path":"/Users/burakemre/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"986:- contradictory early hypotheses in a prior session are not durable evidence -> treat userinfo/profile-scope, workspace, or GET `/mcp` guesses as provisional until live Slack UI/API and prod logs agree [Task 1]\n1263:- when the user asked \"look at prod logs, didn't the main deployed? i thought we fixed this issue\" -> in Lobu production incidents, verify the deployed SHA/image against `origin/main` first, then inspect production logs/state instead of assuming the rollout is stale [Task 1]\n1480:## Task 2: Delete, reinstall, and verify the Lobu Team Gmail connector\n   755\t\n   756\t- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/burakemre/Code/lobu, rollout_path=/Users/burakemre/.codex/sessions/2026/08/01/rollout-2026-08-01T05-15-10-019fbb88-77f6-7850-9f72-cbea21da9700.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-01T15:31:15+00:00, thread_id=019fbb88-77f6-7850-9f72-cbea21da9700, outcome=success)\n   757\t\n   758\t### keywords\n   759\t\n   760\t- Behavior 71, social-interest-radar-v2, name_fields, source_origin_id, Slack previewMode, connection_team_id, behavior_message_subscriptions, uniq_preview_connection_per_platform_all, invalid-index-heal-migration, PR 2428, prod-smoke\n   761\t\n   762\t## User preferences\n   763\t\n   764\t- when the user asked to “actually put an event answering the x linkedin post event linking it” and show “the linkedin post with external link and the agent's answer to it” -> model each radar item as durable linked source/reply events, not only an entity or digest notification [Task 1]\n   765\t- when the user said the behavior must “reliably work” -> validate production writes, notification navigation, source rendering, external links, and repeat/idempotency behavior [Task 1]\n   766\t- when the user asked “why” and then “fix it properly” -> follow production diagnosis through the producer, frontend, regression tests, release, deployment, and live verification rather than stopping at a workaround [Task 2]\n   767\t- when a handoff involves live configuration -> re-check production objects, current `origin/main`, and deployed SHA instead of relying on stale local state; avoid temporary production bindings or append-only test notifications that create durable traffic merely for a green check [Task 3]\n   768\t\n   769\t## Reusable knowledge\n   770\t\n   771\t- `examples/personal-agent/social-interest-radar.reaction.ts` saves markdown reply events through `knowledge.save`, with `parent_event_id`, `behavior_source`, source/window provenance, and durable idempotency keys; one digest should link to `/buremba/memory?content_ids=<source,reply pairs>`, the durable Activity permalink rather than a hand-built Behavior URL. [Task 1]\n   772\t- Behavior 71 version 10 has `keying_config: null`, so new runs no longer promote `social-signal` entities. Production runs and an Activity click verified source/reply linkage, “Replying to” rendering, external links, repeat behavior, and no refreshed `social-signal` entities; exact LinkedIn permalinks require installed connector 3.4.0 plus a fresh feed sync. [Task 1]\n   773\t- Stored Social Radar `resource_url` values can be absolute HTTP(S) URLs. `packages/owletto/src/lib/activity-links.ts::parseAppHref` is the shared boundary for Activity navigation, notification CTAs, peek parsing, and full-page links: normalize HTTP(S) to `pathname + search`, leaving other schemes untouched. Also emit relative app URLs from the Behavior producer going forward. [Task 2]\n   774\t- The successful rollout merged Owletto #683 at `00890074`, then Lobu #2434 at `22b421ab`; 26 targeted tests, full Owletto suite (129 files/1,145 tests), `make pre-pr`, production build/browser-bundle check, CI, Opus review, and a click on an old notification all passed. [Task 2]\n   775\t- Behavior 71 identity remains `key_fields: ['source_origin_id']` with `stable_key`; `name_fields: ['author', 'platform']` is display-only. Version 8/ID 249 triggered successfully, and accidental Slack connection 465 was deleted while 448 and hosted preview 390 remained. [Task 3]\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"986:- contradictory early hypotheses in a prior session are not durable evidence -> treat userinfo/profile-scope, workspace, or GET `/mcp` guesses as provisional until live Slack UI/API and prod logs agree [Task 1]\n1263:- when the user asked \"look at prod logs, didn't the main deployed? i thought we fixed this issue\" -> in Lobu production incidents, verify the deployed SHA/image against `origin/main` first, then inspect production logs/state instead of assuming the rollout is stale [Task 1]\n1480:## Task 2: Delete, reinstall, and verify the Lobu Team Gmail connector\n   755\t\n   756\t- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/burakemre/Code/lobu, rollout_path=/Users/burakemre/.codex/sessions/2026/08/01/rollout-2026-08-01T05-15-10-019fbb88-77f6-7850-9f72-cbea21da9700.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-01T15:31:15+00:00, thread_id=019fbb88-77f6-7850-9f72-c