{"timestamp":"2026-08-13T03:50:19.588Z","ordinal":13521,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019ff72b-b494-79c2-a514-f864fcba9054","turn_id":"019ff8a2-6289-7163-9249-f7ccb2880c20","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_09a8769fe6d6b19a016a7d3ef477c48191a74cde945f543acc","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Done. It is now one org-owned example under `examples/lobu-team`; no Lobu Team digest code remains in core.\n\n- Removed separate `examples/office-bot` and `examples/lobu-team-product-digest`.\n- Live Behavior `99` runs every 20 minutes at `:05/:25/:45`.\n- Production Postgres and Kubernetes/Loki feeds are connected.\n- Rich digest includes users/emails, MCP activity, connections, errors, warnings, and Grafana link.\n- Triggered run `937111` completed and delivered this card to the exact channel: [view Slack digest](https://lobu-ai.slack.com/archives/C0BPWNXR0MP/p1786592708014719).\n- A second no-activity run, `937209`, completed without posting—confirming silence works.\n- “Online users” means users observed in login/MCP activity, deduplicated by email, not literal Slack presence.\n- All relevant PRs are merged, required checks passed, owned worktrees were removed, and the main checkout is clean with no task diff.\n\nThe key merges were [#2717](https://github.com/lobu-ai/lobu/pull/2717), [#2721](https://github.com/lobu-ai/lobu/pull/2721), [#2729](https://github.com/lobu-ai/lobu/pull/2729), and [#2730](https://github.com/lobu-ai/lobu/pull/2730).\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":762,"lineEnd":767,"note":"live production verification and durable notification guidance"}],"rolloutIds":["019fbb88-77f6-7850-9f72-cbea21da9700"]}},"started_at_ms":1786593012499,"completed_at_ms":1786593019588}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-13T03:50:19.594Z","ordinal":13522,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_09a8769fe6d6b19a016a7d3ef477c48191a74cde945f543acc","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Done. It is now one org-owned example under `examples/lobu-team`; no Lobu Team digest code remains in core.\n\n- Removed separate `examples/office-bot` and `examples/lobu-team-product-digest`.\n- Live Behavior `99` runs every 20 minutes at `:05/:25/:45`.\n- Production Postgres and Kubernetes/Loki feeds are connected.\n- Rich digest includes users/emails, MCP activity, connections, errors, warnings, and Grafana link.\n- Triggered run `937111` completed and delivered this card to the exact channel: [view Slack digest](https://lobu-ai.slack.com/archives/C0BPWNXR0MP/p1786592708014719).\n- A second no-activity run, `937209`, completed without posting—confirming silence works.\n- “Online users” means users observed in login/MCP activity, deduplicated by email, not literal Slack presence.\n- All relevant PRs are merged, required checks passed, owned worktrees were removed, and the main checkout is clean with no task diff.\n\nThe key merges were [#2717](https://github.com/lobu-ai/lobu/pull/2717), [#2721](https://github.com/lobu-ai/lobu/pull/2721), [#2729](https://github.com/lobu-ai/lobu/pull/2729), and [#2730](https://github.com/lobu-ai/lobu/pull/2730).\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:762-767|note=[live production verification and durable notification guidance]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n019fbb88-77f6-7850-9f72-cbea21da9700\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>"}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"019ff8a2-6289-7163-9249-f7ccb2880c20"}}}
